    "number": "01",
    "quote": {
      "text": {
        "zh": "我向众生伸出手，触到的却是自己的陌生。\n我与我隔着一生，又在同一次呼吸里重逢。",
        "en": "I reach toward the living and touch the strangeness of myself.\nA lifetime lies between me and myself; we meet again in a single breath."
      },
      "source": {
        "zh": "策展札记",
        "en": "Curatorial note"
      },
      "url": ""
    },
