    "number": "02",
    "quote": {
      "text": {
        "zh": "身体是一个巨大的理性，是有着同一意义的多样性，是战争与和平，是羊群与牧人。",
        "en": "The body is a big sagacity, a plurality with one sense, a war and a peace, a flock and a shepherd."
      },
      "source": {
        "zh": "尼采 · 《查拉图斯特拉如是说·蔑视身体者》（本展译）",
        "en": "Friedrich Nietzsche · Thus Spake Zarathustra, “The Despisers of the Body” (Thomas Common trans.)"
      },
      "url": "https://www.gutenberg.org/files/1998/1998-h/1998-h.htm"
    },
