        ],
        "guide": {
          "text": {
            "zh": "蛹化成了蝶\n抖动 抖动\n一直抖,\n一直动\n凤翅而舞\n望这旖旎风月\n尽然，\n装不下这\n一丝尘土",
            "en": "The chrysalis became a butterfly\nTrembling, trembling\nStill trembling,\nstill moving\nDancing on phoenix wings\nBehold this world of sensual beauty\nand yet,\nit cannot hold\na single speck of dust"
          },
          "source": {
