        "guide": {
          "text": {
            "zh": "我在万物里认出我，也在万物里失去我。\n此刻，生与死借同一副身体相拥。",
            "en": "In all things I recognise myself, and in all things I lose myself.\nHere, life and death borrow the same body for their embrace."
          },
          "source": {
