    "number": "04",
    "quote": {
      "text": {
        "zh": "我不再急于回答，哪一个是我。\n此刻，万物与我同息。",
        "en": "I am no longer in haste to answer which of these is me.\nFor this moment, all things breathe with me."
      },
      "source": {
        "zh": "策展札记",
        "en": "Curatorial note"
      },
